                                    xi, the standing PAPER8 value 0.10 / 0.15 pc     1.0000e-04               -6.78
                              c / H0 (the one intrinsic length of the cosmology)     4.4480e+06               +3.87
                                c^2 / a0 (L17's unique filter length, canonical)     3.1112e+07               +4.71
